# Allowlist by design: this root holds 50k+ files (Corpus, Backups, Models,
# Imports, Manifests, Compose, Projects) that must never be swept into git.
# Ignore everything, then explicitly un-ignore only the root docs meant to be
# tracked here. Do not switch this to a denylist pattern.
*

!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!AGENTS.md
!.clinerules/
!.clinerules/**
!memory-bank/
!memory-bank/**
!requirements-dev.txt
!pyproject.toml
!.github/
!.github/**
!PR_BODY.md
!Projects/WorkShade/CHANGELOG_ingest_delo_proposals.md

# Typical ignores
node_modules/
dist/
build/
target/

.env
.env.*

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log

.vscode/

tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
*.bak
